+/// What the CI build of the engine registers: everything `clickhouse-local` does, except dictionaries. It replaces
+/// `registerIsolate.cpp`, whose short list is sized for a Worker; a CI service has no limit on the size of its code,
+/// and wants every function, storage (the whole `MergeTree` family, `MaterializedView`) and interpreter, so that
+/// it accepts what a server accepts. `ObjectMergeTree` is not registered: `MergeTree` is the real one here, with its
+/// parts in Emscripten's in-memory file system.
+
+#include <Databases/registerDatabases.h>
+#include <Disks/registerDisks.h>
